          "kicker": "Hooker audition",
          "heading": "Gabe Oghre and Jamie Blamire boost England hooking options amid Tuipulotu concern",
          "body": "Gabe Oghre and Jamie Blamire both made strong cases in Leicester's 22-16 PREM win at Bristol Bears on Friday, Planet Rugby's winners-and-losers verdict reads, with the pair's set-piece work framed as a final audition. The spotlight follows an injury concern to Kepu Tuipulotu ahead of the Nations Championship, and the verdict expects both to make the training squad next week. Blamire also got himself on the scoreboard at a crucial period in the contest."
        },
