          "kicker": "Squad watch",
          "heading": "France yet to name matchday squad for Springboks Test after injuries",
          "body": "No matchday squad for France's Test against South Africa has been reported, and today's coverage carries no update on the injury setbacks. The latest blow was first reported by SA Rugby Magazine in mid-October, ahead of the Springboks meeting. Who is available for the Test therefore remains unconfirmed until the squad is named, and no outlet has reported that announcement yet."
