          "kicker": "Under-18 result",
          "heading": "Italy U18 come from behind to beat Ireland 36-29 at Badia Polesine",
          "body": "Italy U18 came back from 17-12 down at half-time to beat Ireland 36-29 at Badia Polesine on Saturday, a repeat of last year's win over them in Cosenza. Captain Mesaglio scored Italy's first try, and Fanzo and Agressi both crossed after Ireland had led 22-12 early in the second half, Agressi's try giving the Azzurrini a 26-22 lead. Nikitakos's second yellow card came in the first half, just before Ireland's try that stretched their lead."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji draft ex-England international Nathan Hughes into Nations squad",
          "body": "Argentina lose Santiago Grondona to injury before Ireland test. England's Kepu Tuipulotu injury concern ahead of Nations Championship."
        }
