          "kicker": "Warriors win",
          "heading": "Fergus Watson scores opening try as Glasgow beat Lions 28-20 at Scotstoun",
          "body": "Fergus Watson scored the opening try and was named Player of the Match in Glasgow Warriors' 28-20 URC win over the Lions at Scotstoun. He collected a stunning cross kick from Dan Lancaster and skinned Chris Smith on the way over. Glasgow led 19-3 at half-time, with Lancaster also crossing before the break. Morne van den Berg's second-half try brought the Lions within seven, but Glasgow held on."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
