          "heading": "Carwyn Leggatt-Jones and Ioan Nicholas catch eye in Scarlets' Pretoria defeat",
          "body": "The Scarlets were beaten 54-26 by the Bulls in Pretoria after threatening a shock before falling away late on, but WalesOnline's ratings argue the display shows why Wales coaches are watching. Fly-half Carwyn Leggatt-Jones was rated a seven for \"Another assured performance by the young fly-half\", while Ioan Nicholas also earned a seven, having once again beaten defenders for fun."
