          "heading": "Facundo Isa recalled to Argentina squad for Ireland, replacing injured Santiago Grondona",
          "body": "Facundo Isa is back in the Argentina squad for the Ireland test, called up in place of the injured Santiago Grondona. The veteran has missed out on international duty in 2024 and 2026, and last played for Argentina in July 2025. Contepomi's 33-man group heads to Dublin with Santiago Grondona, Ignacio Ruiz and Joaquín Oviedo all unavailable, and Oviedo, Gallo and Carreras out long term."
