          "heading": "Japan won three of last five, losing 28-34 to Fiji in October",
          "body": "Japan have won three and lost two in their last five games, with the sequence running L W W W L, most recent first. The latest of those defeats came in October's International Friendlies at home, when Fiji beat them 34-28 and Japan scored 28. Next up is Wales in Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
