      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad versatility",
          "heading": "Leicester Fainga'anuku's hybrid role gives Rennie bench options, Stephen Donald says",
          "body": "Stephen Donald believes Leicester Fainga'anuku, named in the All Blacks squad for the November matches after missing the July games, gives Dave Rennie real bench flexibility. The 27-year-old has mostly played centre or wing but started several games at openside flanker in Super Rugby Pacific this year. A starting spot might be a stretch, but Donald argues: \"what doesn't Leicester cover?\" It is expected Fainga'anuku will feature in the first northern Test."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Fiji draft ex-England international Nathan Hughes into Nations squad",
          "body": "Argentina lose Santiago Grondona to injury before Ireland test. England's Kepu Tuipulotu injury concern ahead of Nations Championship."
