    "467": {
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "edition": "Sunday 1 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Springbok props",
          "heading": "Wilco Louw, Ntuthuko Mchunu power Stormers' scrum in 33-7 win over Ulster",
          "body": "Wilco Louw and Ntuthuko Mchunu were the platform as the Stormers beat Ulster 33-7 at DHL Stadium on Saturday. The Springbok props regularly sent Ulster's scrum into reverse, and the home pack's maul superiority carried the Cape Town side up the field, leading to a yellow card for visiting prop Keynan Knox. The Stormers were wasteful in the opening half-hour, but the set-piece gave them control. Both props have been named in Rassie Erasmus' Nations Championship squad."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
